## Entry Points
- `main()` → `run_bot()`
- `Cargo.toml` [[bin]] `install` for setup
- Web UI served at `https://localhost:8443` (TLS by default)

## Current State & Gaps

- WebSocket ↔ Bus round-trip is the most mature path
- Terminal and UNIX socket I/O are under-connected
- CPU is currently more of a coordinator than a central router
- Full agent runtime (`RuntimeLoop`) is available but not yet the default execution path
- Context Engine / Router is implemented but not yet deeply integrated into the main CPU path
- Skill Registry and MemoryManager are fully functional and wired into HyEvo/CPU
- Logging/audit bus provides excellent message-level visibility; arbitration layer is present but rudimentary (LLM-based skill picker only)

